{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I. Exploring the Abandoned City</strong><br>The city lies in ruins. To survive, scour every corner - you never know what crucial resources you might find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Gathering Supplies</strong><br>Stockpile materials to build defenses and rescue survivors. Every scrap counts in your struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/61f32cf9200cc9c5f058b87070c8439f.poster.avif?t=1759544684\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/61f32cf9200cc9c5f058b87070c8439f.webm?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/61f32cf9200cc9c5f058b87070c8439f.mp4?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Recruiting Survivors</strong><br>Find allies to help gather resources and fight off nightly zombie hordes. Many possess unique skills that could prove vital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/67c6537a5a55e8cbe28dcb219680dbec.poster.avif?t=1759544684\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/67c6537a5a55e8cbe28dcb219680dbec.webm?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/67c6537a5a55e8cbe28dcb219680dbec.mp4?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Building Defenses</strong><br>Erect walls and install various turrets to protect your camp after dark. Adapt your designs to the environment for maximum effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/b0142c46b10e488434e4981ea4f385b1.poster.avif?t=1759544684\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/b0142c46b10e488434e4981ea4f385b1.webm?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/b0142c46b10e488434e4981ea4f385b1.mp4?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Equipping Gear</strong><br>Search the city for scattered equipment. Only properly armed survivors can stand against the terrors of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/544d83294bc531ae447b7e6899926ffa.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1520 height=1012 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Scouting New Districts</strong><br>Uncharted areas typically swarm with zombies. Prepare thoroughly before venturing into these dangerous zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/9f3da34cac4ec677810c4e1901537940.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1434 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Advancing to New Territory</strong><br>When you've exhausted a district's resources, move your mobile base to the next area and begin anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/4d0c4f79ae734a338768b538cf490271.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1400 height=934 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>II. Upgrading Your Mobile Base</strong><br>Enhance your vehicle with new equipment and modifications to gain tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/55380506611e1cb668409b1cf2aa6b59.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1518 height=1012 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>III. Surviving the Night</strong><br>Daylight offers relative safety as zombies hide in the shadows. But when night falls, they emerge with terrifying aggression, attacking in coordinated waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/243a456ee2128c75010b1383f6c196b6.poster.avif?t=1759544684\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/243a456ee2128c75010b1383f6c196b6.webm?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/243a456ee2128c75010b1383f6c196b6.mp4?t=1759544684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IV. Strategic Evacuation</strong><br>Beyond the regular nightly assaults, periodic zombie tides threaten to overwhelm your defenses. Evacuate districts before these massive hordes arrive to ensure your group's survival.</p>","background":"https://stor