 height=1012 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Scouting New Districts</strong><br>Uncharted areas typically swarm with zombies. Prepare thoroughly before venturing into these dangerous zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/9f3da34cac4ec677810c4e1901537940.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1434 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Advancing to New Territory</strong><br>When you've exhausted a district's resources, move your mobile base to the next area and begin anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/4d0c4f79ae734a338768b538cf490271.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1400 height=934 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>II. Upgrading Your Mobile Base</strong><br>Enhance your vehicle with new equipment and modifications to gain tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/55380506611e1cb668409b1cf2aa6b59.avif?t=1759544684\" width=1518 height=1012 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>III. Surviving the Night</strong><br>Daylight offers relative safety as zombies hide in the shadows. But when night falls, they emerge with terrifying aggression, attacking in coordinated waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972280/extras/243a456ee2128c75010b1383f6c196b6.poster.avif?t=1759544684\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"http